exports[`C10 §4k — the compositions, as frames > the owed compositions name the change that would give each a subject 1`] = `
"2 · hovering one link while another has keyboard focus
    no render seam carries a hover: the router discards a no-button move by rule (C16 §4a row t) and RenderContext has no field for it (M7)
3 · selection over a diff ground
    \`patch\` declares no elements and reads ctx.focus nowhere, so no patch row can be selected (C25, M9)
5 · disabled + error
    \`disabled\` is an availability fact and no block carries the field (M4)"
`;
